  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of local capacities in terms of Search for Missing and Unlocated Persons.

The project seeks to contribute to the implementation of exhumation processes with a massive approach and those corresponding to the investigation and documentation of victims, anthropology and forensic genetics.</narrative>
